  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## Summary\n- CheckEngineV2: complete plan/executor rewrite of the check hot path, replacing the recursive V1 walk\n  - Sibling-relation batching + relational plan-rewrite seam (#259)\n  - M1 wave-shaped driver loop, drain-time drop, M3 wave telemetry (#264)\n  - Postgres DbBatch executor + R4 attribute sibling batch (#265)\n  - SqlServer DbBatch executor () (#266)\n  - Publish CheckV2 seams, move fusion to , drop production  (#267)\n  - R3: plan-time TTU fast-path eligibility (#268)\n  - R2: userset 2-hop join fast path (#269)\n  - R1: boolean-combination fusion (#271)\n  - Native Explain — runs the real plan/executor instead of delegating to V1 (#272)\n  - Pre-work: hazard stress specs, V2 gate counters, R1/R2 benchmark baselines (#263)\n- Decorate whichever  is registered, not hardcoded V1 (#261)\n- Fix: work around SqlServer  connection leak from broken  (#270)\n- Fix: prevent parallel publish runs on release created+published (#257)\n- Chore: migrate  to  format (#262)",
